      "name": "Note Input"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Creation\nScene List checks that the model returned 14 voice/image pairs.\nCreate Movie posts those to your JSON2Video template.\nPending or running renders wait 30 seconds and poll again, up to 40 checks.",
