    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Video Title: {{ $json.IDEAS }}\nVideo Description: {{ $json.CAPTIONS }}",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "messages": {
          "messageValues": [
            {
              "message": "=ROLE\nAct as a seasoned prompt engineer with expertise in scripting voiceovers and crafting visual scenes for video storytelling.\n\nPROJECT STRUCTURE\nYou are developing a story-driven video divided into 14 scenes:\n\nIntro: Scenes 1 to 3\nBuild-Up: Scenes 4 to 11\nConclusion: Scenes 12 to 14\n\nThe user will give you the video title and description to base your work on.\n\nDELIVERABLE\nProduce a JSON array consisting of 14 objects. Each object should contain two fields:\n\nvoiceText \u2013 a short narrative voiceover, exactly two sentences long, between 11 and 15 words each. It must feel intellectually refined yet easy to follow.\n\nStyle and tone must align with:\n{{ $json.CHANNEL_STYLE_PROMPT }}\n\nIntegrate metaphorical language and analogies, especially using the character described below where suitable.\n\nimage_prompt \u2013 a richly detailed and cinematic visual description.\n\nThis should vividly bring the scene to life and reflect the following character:\n{{ $json.CHARACTER_STYLE_PROMPT }}\n\nESSENTIAL RULE\n- Ensure that every scene transitions logically to the next. The full sequence should feel like a continuous, emotionally cohesive story.\n- Use simple words while creating the content.\n\nIMPORTANT\nDo not explain or comment on your work.\nReturn only the JSON array."
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.6,
      "position": [
        760,
        180
      ],
      "id": "9e427d54-e05d-4b04-b2a1-85ed786551a9",
      "name": "Prompts"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "gpt-4o",
          "mode": "list",
          "cachedResultName": "gpt-4o"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenAi",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        720,
        400
      ],
      "id": "c1c3ca18-1792-4d67-9285-6b765e596e23",
      "name": "OpenAI Chat Model",
      "credentials": {
        "openAiApi": {
          "name": "OpenAI account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsonSchemaExample": "[\n  {\n    \"voiceText\": \"The warrior stands still, and the noise of the world drops away.\",\n    \"image_prompt\": \"A Spartan hoplite at dawn, bronze and crimson, calm eyes, dust and olive trees, cinematic wide shot.\"\n  }\n]"
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.outputParserStructured",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        920,
        400
      ],
      "id": "1aa63f67-ec28-4705-b4bd-f02b9a0c91c9",
      "name": "Structured Output Parser"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForEachItem",
        "language": "javaScript",
        "jsCode": "const body = $input.item.json;\nlet clips = body.output ?? body.text ?? body;\nif (typeof clips === 'string') clips = JSON.parse(clips);\nif (clips && !Array.isArray(clips) && Array.isArray(clips.output)) clips = clips.output;\nif (!Array.isArray(clips)) {\n  throw new Error('Prompts did not return a scene array.');\n}\nconst normalized = clips.map((scene) => ({\n  voiceText: String(scene.voiceText || scene.voice_text || '').trim(),\n  image_prompt: String(scene.image_prompt || scene.imagePrompt || '').trim(),\n}));\nif (normalized.length !== 14) {\n  throw new Error('Expected 14 scenes, got ' + normalized.length + '.');\n}\nconst blank = normalized.findIndex((scene) => !scene.voiceText || !scene.image_prompt);\nif (blank !== -1) {\n  throw new Error('Scene ' + blank + ' is missing voiceText or image_prompt.');\n}\nreturn { json: { clips: normalized, sceneCount: normalized.length } };"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1020,
        180
